@base = http://127.0.0.1:8088/api
@buyerToken = REPLACE_WITH_BUYER_JWT
@sellerToken = REPLACE_WITH_SELLER_JWT
@orderId = 1

### 查询并按需初始化个人钱包
GET {{base}}/finance/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}

### 充值只写个人账户
POST {{base}}/finance/recharge
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 23.23,
  "channel": "ALIPAY"
}

### 查询个人流水
GET {{base}}/finance/my-wallet/records
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}

### 普通用户查询经营流水，应返回业务码 403
GET {{base}}/finance/business/records
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}

### 确认收货触发结算
POST {{base}}/order/{{orderId}}/confirm-receive
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}

### 官方卖家查询经营流水
GET {{base}}/finance/business/records
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}
